{"4253450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "COMEBACK", "steam_appid": 4253450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMEBACK is a handpainted action roguelite/Slice of life where you fight across different floors levels trying to find find a mysterious enemy, After every run you return to home and can prepare for your journey again by preparing different foods, crafting accessories with different effects and having some nice and chill downtime before each attempt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is told 100% visually with Animation, Paintings and enviromental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/bfc49ded6c3e3b2e5ba215ad1aedb98f.poster.avif?t=1774284476\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/bfc49ded6c3e3b2e5ba215ad1aedb98f.webm?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/bfc49ded6c3e3b2e5ba215ad1aedb98f.mp4?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Level UP different accessories:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/ff97df8788b66a1fb5a91f04b9fba13f.poster.avif?t=1774284476\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/ff97df8788b66a1fb5a91f04b9fba13f.webm?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/ff97df8788b66a1fb5a91f04b9fba13f.mp4?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each equipment features different skills that affect how you play or with attribute you decide to improve on your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/02ae640613bc8379d199325062dfd6aa.poster.avif?t=1774284476\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/02ae640613bc8379d199325062dfd6aa.webm?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/02ae640613bc8379d199325062dfd6aa.mp4?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Morning, prepare for your day:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/5560e2d5bf41ff432d62bc20616781fd.poster.avif?t=1774284476\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/5560e2d5bf41ff432d62bc20616781fd.webm?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253450/extras/5560e2d5bf41ff432d62bc20616781fd.mp4?t=1774284476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of everyday prepare for your Run by cooking different foods with a series of effects that can affect how you play, do home activies 